proposals.description:
A pure universe/battleDifficulty.js: difficulty(stats) = clamp(1 + 0.15·(killsPerMin - 2) - 0.3·deathsLast5Min - (shield < 35 ? 0.2 : 0), 0.6, 1.6), from the player's own local stats. It scales:
- the attack-token pool on you: round(2·d), 1-4, replacing onYou 4 and the 'always 2 within 70' rule at battle.js:438-443, via squad.js createTokens scale;
- enemy laser spread: 0.02/d;
- whether the ace duels you: d ≥ 1.2;
- flak range on you: 25·min(1, d).
It changes only what shoots at you, never director state, tally keys or AI progress.
